{"id":"a8917c9236b2d1d3870da9f351e2bdd694498fb3","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1245169","title":"codex 回复的消息，文件改动卡片消失了","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"Bisn","excerpt":"OpenAI - @Bisn - codex 的版本是 26.924.22138 ，升级后，修改代码后，哪些文件修改这样的卡片没有了怎么改回来？ 还是 codex 有 bug ？![]( https://i.v2ex.","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"Wrapper\">\n                \n                \n<div><p>codex 的版本是 26.924.22138 ，升级后，修改代码后，哪些文件修改这样的卡片没有了</p>\n<p>怎么改回来？ 还是 codex 有 bug ？</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://i.v2ex.co/2dau6Apu.png\"></p>\n</div>\n\n<!-- SOL tip topic -->\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/Codex\"><li></li> Codex</a><a href=\"/tag/文件\"><li></li> 文件</a><a href=\"/tag/卡片\"><li></li> 卡片</a></P><p><span>7 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-09-29 02:15:48 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18132223\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/e7f8/f150/555057_normal.png?m=1666850391\" alt=\"f5a599\" data-uid=\"555057\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>1</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/f5a599\">f5a599</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-28 10:56:17 +08:00\">21h 14m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <div><p>我感觉和降智一起发生的</p><p>可能是降智导致一些格式没有按指令生成</p><p>或者 Codex 的屎山推不下去了</p></div>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18132292\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/b16b/362c/577927_normal.png?m=1736328705\" alt=\"duty\" data-uid=\"577927\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/duty\">duty</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-28 11:05:25 +08:00\">21h 5m ago</span>  &#160; <span><img src=\"/static/img/heart_20250818.png?v=c3415183a0b3e9ab1576251be69d7d6d\" width=\"14\" alt=\"❤️\"> 1</span>\n                    \n                    <p>要求中加一句 \"- 用 edit 工具来写代码，不要用 Python 来写入\"，6 这个模型在改文件时总是倾向于用 python 来改，所以跟踪不到变动</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18132343\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/ca735d94f1dbef0c0242df255d94fb10?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"sickworm\" data-uid=\"279943\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/sickworm\">sickworm</a></strong> &#160; <div><p>PRO</p></div>&#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-28 11:10:59 +08:00\">20h 59m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>昨天 6 sol 有几次感觉不太对劲，突然指令遵循的很差</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18132446\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/81c2/f886/2704_normal.png?m=1789647742\" alt=\"keakon\" data-uid=\"2704\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/keakon\">keakon</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-28 11:23:12 +08:00\">20h 47m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>codex 只有 apply_patch 工具，没有 edit 工具</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18132542\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img s